        },
        {
          "text": "Agho kabona anainhikanga olwala lwe mu musaayi gw'ensolo eyo, yaagusiiga ku bintu ebiri ng'oti mayiga ga nsolo ebiri ku alutaari eyokerwaku ebigheebwayo. Ogusigairegho yaagufuka ku ntobo y'alutaari eyo. ",
          "type": "text",
