        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu oyo aleese ensolo eyo, anaagitoolangamu amasavu goonagoona, ng'oti ni bwe gatoolebwa mu nsolo ey'ekigheebwayo olw'okutabagana. Olwo kabona yaagookera ku alutaari, gaavaamu akawoowo akasangaaza Musengwa Katonda. Atyo kabona bw'anaaghangayo omusengo olw'ekibi ky'omuntu oyo, era omuntu oyo aidha kusoniyibwanga.",
          "type": "text",
